---
/* Roots & Routes: built by scripts/build-tree-page.py from the roster, dossiers, households and direct line, and rendered here inside the
   site layout (header, menu, footer). The fragment carries its own scoped styles and script (every selector under #rr), and no living
   person is drawn: tree.json also carries the living people the archive already names as name-and-links rows (policy "names", David 17 Nov 2026), which this page drops on load. THIS PAGE IS NOINDEX (David, 17 Nov 2026) and the kit's sitemap tool leaves it out, because its data names living people. Rebuild with `python3 scripts/build-tree-page.py`; see data/tree-page/README.md. A standalone copy of the
   page is kept at data/tree-page/roots.html. */
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import page from "../../../../data/tree-page/roots.embed.html?raw";
import { meta } from "../../../../data/tree-page/tree.json";
---
<Base title={meta.title} dek={meta.sub} noautolink noindex>
  <Fragment set:html={page} />
</Base>
